,"l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jen Dardis","x":"…expenses in Q1 primarily reflect lower stock-based compensation expense related to the firm's annual equity grant, as well as the absence of severance and other costs associated with the workforce reduction action recognized in Q4 2022, which more than offset the Q1 impact of annual increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2023 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2023-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Sharps","x":"Stronger equity markets helped lift revenue from first quarter levels, and we identified substantial cost savings that will allow us to meaningfully slow expense growth while continuing to pursue our strategic initiatives.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2023 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2023-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jen Dardis","x":"Most of the costs related to the recent reduction in force will be incurred in the third quarter and are already included in our expense guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2023 Q3","e":"trow","d":"2023-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Sharps","x":"We made progress on our strategic initiatives and we executed on planned cost savings efforts.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2023 Q3","e":"trow","d":"2023-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jen Dardis","x":"The Q3 included severance costs related to our July reduction in force and higher carried interest related expense, partially offset by a non-recurring benefit in G&A. For full year 2023, we are narrowing our guidance range for adjusted operating expense, excluding the carried interest related…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2023 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2024-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Eric Veiel","x":"Our Research.AI generative AI tool is in beta test with 80 investment professionals, and represents a promising start to what is sure to be a continued investment in this area.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2024 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2025-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Sharps","x":"So I'd say there is scope for some structural cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q1","e":"trow","d":"2025-05-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Sharps","x":"In equity, value outperformed growth in the quarter, amid a shift in sentiment driven by tariff concerns and a sell-off in the technology sector.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q1","e":"trow","d":"2025-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jen Dardis","x":"All of that said, as we've said in prior quarters, we're continuing to evaluate opportunities for more structural cost savings to limit expense growth in 2026 and beyond.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2025-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Sharps","x":"I mean as an example, I think AI can have a very large impact on how we create investment solutions and deliver real-time curated advice and service across channels, whether that's to major intermediary partners and institutions or Individual Investors or DC plan participants.","url":"https://investors.troweprice.com/static-files/8edd53d5-683a-49f9-ad98-a48504bd27eb"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2025-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Sharps","x":"The elements of that include reassessing our org structure and workspaces, streamlining processes and leveraging technology, including AI as well as partnerships, and I think much of this work will play out this year and next.","url":"https://investors.troweprice.com/static-files/8edd53d5-683a-49f9-ad98-a48504bd27eb"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2025-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Sharps","x":"AI can clearly help drive productivity and cost savings.","url":"https://investors.troweprice.com/static-files/8edd53d5-683a-49f9-ad98-a48504bd27eb"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q3","e":"trow","d":"2025-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert W. Sharps","x":"I also would say that we are freeing up resources to invest in our AI capabilities enterprise-wide, which I think, to some extent, can give us payback from a productivity perspective, but I think also can help us execute and deliver better on behalf of our clients over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/02/t-rowe-price-trow-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q3","e":"trow","d":"2025-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Benson Dardis","x":"In Q3, we incurred $28.5 million in non-recurring costs, primarily severance and related compensation associated with these actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/02/t-rowe-price-trow-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q3","e":"trow","d":"2025-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Benson Dardis","x":"Number one, we did the reduction in force in July.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/02/t-rowe-price-trow-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert W. Sharps","x":"We advanced our use of artificial intelligence across the firm, amplifying our investment professionals' capabilities without replacing their judgment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/t-rowe-price-trow-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Fannon","x":"Along those same lines, on the AI disruption, what is Oak Hill's exposure to investments potentially disrupted by AI?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/t-rowe-price-trow-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert W. Sharps","x":"So we have a number of initiatives to drive cost savings to fund those investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/t-rowe-price-trow-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Benson Dardis","x":"And as Rob mentioned, that's a balance of cost savings efforts and also earmarking funds to be able to invest in some of our growth areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/t-rowe-price-trow-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Eric Lanoue Veiel","x":"As you think about what happened yesterday and the disruption risk of AI, specifically some very unique opportunities that were brought forward by Anthropic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/t-rowe-price-trow-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2025 Q4","e":"trow","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Eric Lanoue Veiel","x":"But what happened yesterday in terms of the potential disruption of AI across different parts of the software industry is not a surprise to us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/t-rowe-price-trow-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2026 Q1","e":"trow","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Sharps","x":"…away from the hyperscalers where energy has performed well, where sectors that are exposed to the AI infrastructure build-out, whether it's semiconductors in technology, or areas like power, or kind of certain componentry have really, really benefited from the accelerating CapEx of the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/t-rowe-price-trow-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2026 Q1","e":"trow","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jen Dardis","x":"Adjusted operating expenses in both the current and prior quarters also reflect cost savings delivered through our ongoing excess management program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/t-rowe-price-trow-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2026 Q1","e":"trow","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Unknown Executive","x":"At the start of this year, markets were [indiscernible] by rapid AI advancements that resulted in concerns at disruption risk among the incumbent software providers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/t-rowe-price-trow-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2026 Q1","e":"trow","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Unknown Executive","x":"And while the impact of AI disruption will create winners and losers, these dynamics will play out over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/t-rowe-price-trow-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2026 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2026-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rob Sharps","x":"We are scaling advanced agent-driven capabilities from AI-powered investment research and portfolio insights to sales and client workflows, enhancing decision-making speed and consistency while keeping investment judgment and fiduciary responsibility firmly with our associates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/t-rowe-price-trow-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TROW 2026 Q2","e":"trow","d":"2026-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jen Dardis","x":"…with ongoing savings efforts, will allow us to continue to invest in areas of future growth, including ETFs and SMAs, delivering outcome-oriented solutions for clients,